10
00:00:45,790 --> 00:00:49,710
Someone asks a very simple question like, tell me about yourself.

11
00:00:49,710 --> 00:00:53,110
And suddenly it feels like a very difficult question.

12
00:00:53,110 --> 00:00:54,370
Exactly.

13
