29
00:01:51,030 --> 00:01:52,950
All right, Emily. Let's begin.

30
00:01:52,950 --> 00:01:58,350
Sure. David, let me ask you a question that many interviewers ask. Tell me about

31
00:01:58,350 --> 00:01:59,350
