32
00:01:59,350 --> 00:02:04,510
That's a great question, and it's definitely one of the most common questions in interviews.

33
00:02:04,510 --> 00:02:09,290
When answering this question, I usually start with a brief introduction about my professional

34
00:02:09,290 --> 00:02:10,290
background.

35
00:02:10,290 --> 00:02:13,290
Why do you start with your professional background?

36
00:02:13,290 --> 00:02:18,330
Because in most professional situations, the person asking the question wants to understand

37
00:02:18,330 --> 00:02:22,930
