43
00:02:35,930 --> 00:02:38,330
That sounds very clear and professional.

44
00:02:38,330 --> 00:02:39,330
Thank you.

45
00:02:39,330 --> 00:02:42,730
It gives a quick overview of who I am professionally.

46
00:02:42,730 --> 00:02:46,430
