73
00:04:12,490 --> 00:04:14,930
That's a good way to highlight a specific skill.

74
00:04:14,930 --> 00:04:20,310
Yes, and sometimes I also include a short example to support that statement.

75
00:04:20,310 --> 00:04:21,910
Would you give an example of that?

76
00:04:21,910 --> 00:04:22,910
Sure.

77
00:04:22,910 --> 00:04:28,270
I might add something like, in my previous role, I helped launch a social media campaign

78
00:04:28,270 --> 00:04:32,350
