118
00:06:36,110 --> 00:06:40,910
growing professionally and contribute to meaningful marketing initiatives.

119
00:06:40,910 --> 00:06:42,690
That's an excellent introduction.

120
00:06:42,690 --> 00:06:46,310
It sounds natural, professional, and well-organized.

121
00:06:46,310 --> 00:06:47,310
Thank you.

122
00:06:47,310 --> 00:06:49,870
I noticed that your answer follows a clear structure.

123
00:06:49,870 --> 00:06:52,190
Yes, that's very important.

124
00:06:52,190 --> 00:06:54,750
Could you explain that structure for our listeners?

125
00:06:54,750 --> 00:06:55,750
Of course.

126
00:06:55,750 --> 00:06:58,030
The structure is actually quite simple.

127
00:06:58,030 --> 00:07:00,030
First, introduce yourself.

128
00:07:00,030 --> 00:07:03,190
Second, talk about your background or education.

129
00:07:03,190 --> 00:07:08,830
Third, describe your experience and skills, and finally, mention your goals or what you're

130
00:07:08,830 --> 00:07:09,830
