131
00:07:09,830 --> 00:07:11,990
That's a very helpful framework.

132
00:07:11,990 --> 00:07:18,030
Yes, and once you understand that structure, it becomes much easier to organize your thoughts.

133
00:07:18,030 --> 00:07:20,470
