141
00:07:39,830 --> 00:07:43,990
I recently joined the marketing team as a digital marketing specialist.

142
00:07:43,990 --> 00:07:49,030
I have experience working with social media campaigns and online advertising, and I'm

143
00:07:49,030 --> 00:07:51,950
