144
00:07:51,950 --> 00:07:53,830
That sounds friendly and professional.

145
00:07:53,830 --> 00:07:57,750
Yes, and it helps create a positive first impression.

146
00:07:57,750 --> 00:08:01,350
Most impressions are very important in professional environments.

147
00:08:01,350 --> 00:08:02,350
Absolutely.

148
00:08:02,350 --> 00:08:06,950
A good self-introduction can make people feel more comfortable and interested in working

149
00:08:06,950 --> 00:08:08,030
