150
00:08:08,030 --> 00:08:12,510
Some people also like to include a little personal information in their introduction.

151
00:08:12,510 --> 00:08:15,590
That can be a nice touch depending on the situation.

152
00:08:15,590 --> 00:08:16,710
For example?

153
