154
00:08:22,750 --> 00:08:26,790
work, I enjoy reading, traveling, and learning new languages.

155
00:08:26,790 --> 00:08:30,110
That makes the introduction feel more human and relatable.

156
00:08:30,110 --> 00:08:31,230
Exactly.

157
00:08:31,230 --> 00:08:36,710
