158
00:08:36,710 --> 00:08:38,390
That's a good point.

159
00:08:38,390 --> 00:08:41,870
The key is to keep the introduction balanced.

160
00:08:41,870 --> 00:08:45,030
Another thing beginners sometimes worry about is pronunciation.

161
00:08:45,030 --> 00:08:49,830
Yes, many people feel nervous about speaking English in front of others.

162
00:08:49,830 --> 00:08:52,270
