00:17:41,990 --> 00:17:45,590
Yes, and eventually, you won't need to think about every word.

335
00:17:45,590 --> 00:17:49,790
Another helpful tip is to listen to how other people introduce themselves.

336
00:17:49,790 --> 00:17:56,030
Yes, listening to conversations, interviews, or podcasts can give you many useful ideas.

337
00:17:56,030 --> 00:17:59,830
You may notice common phrases and structures that people use.

338
00:17:59,830 --> 00:18:03,570
And you can adapt those phrases to create your own introduction.

339
00:18:03,570 --> 00:18:08,110
